    "title": "Wake sheriff: Deputy fired, arrested on charges of tipping off suspects about felony warrants - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By WRAL News staff ,\n2 hours ago\nA Wake County deputy on Thursday was charged with giving suspects a heads-up when they had arrest warrants. According to the Wake County Sheriff's Office, investigators received reports that a deputy had improperly used government property. On Thursday, 29-year-old Anthony Garcia, a Wake County deputy, was arrested at the sheriff's office.\nRead full article\nAdd to Preferred Sources",
